{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/components/styles","title":"Styling a component: the only way","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"styling-a-component-the-only-way","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Styling a component: the only way"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A component is styled through "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/style/","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/style"}]},{"t":"text","text":", and through"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"nothing else. Its visual rules live in a "},{"t":"code","text":"*.style.ts"},{"t":"text","text":" sheet beside it; the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"template binds the sheet's classes, sets "},{"t":"code","text":"data-*"},{"t":"text","text":" attributes for its variants,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and writes typed variables for what changes at runtime. There is no CSS string"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"on the meta, no "},{"t":"code","text":".css"},{"t":"text","text":" import, no class assembled at render time and no raw"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"style"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"That is not a preference. A class built in the browser, or a rule shipped as a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"string, is a visual state nothing recorded: the "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/style/testing","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"visual matrix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"enumerates what the sheets declare, the "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/style/contrast","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"static contrast check"}]},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"measures what the sheets write, and anything outside them is invisible to both."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"ESLint and the architecture suite therefore refuse every other route, and the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"